          "slide_label": "Slide 3",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "structure your runs like this:\n• easy run\n• speed run\n• long run"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 4,
          "slide_label": "Slide 4",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "best lifting split for you:\n• upper body\n• lower body\n• full body. trains everything without wrecking your legs all week"
